The script performs AWS CLI validation, installation (if required), and automatically provisions an EC2 instance.

---

## Features

-  Checks if AWS CLI is installed (check_awscli)
-  Installs AWS CLI if not present (install_awscli)
- Creates EC2 instance (create_ec2_instance)
- Waits until instance is in running state (wait_for_running)
- Fully automated provisioning

---

## How to Run

1. Clone this repository
   
         git clone 
         cd 

2. Give execute permission
 
         chmod +x create-ec2-instance.sh

3. Run the script

         ./create-ec2-instance.sh